    <title>Profile Centevo | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Profile Centevo | 919 följare på LinkedIn. Profile Centevo is a specialised provider of Asset and Fund Management solutions in the Nordic region.

Our solutions cover the areas of Asset Management, Fund Management, Trust Management and Family Office, whilst offering powerful API connection gateways to large local Banks.

We create client value by offering a process that allows you to manage all aspects of your business digitally, from defining your clients, customising your offer and possibly using automatic asset allocation (robo-advice).">

