    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Profile Centevo","url":"https://se.linkedin.com/company/centevo-ab"},"datePublished":"2026-08-24T08:28:13.479Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_financialservices-ai-fundmanagement-activity-7497570450399617027-DDTY","text":"Artificial Intelligence is receiving enormous attention across #FinancialServices.\n\nBut its greatest impact won't come from replacing investment professionals.\n\nIt will come from removing friction.\n\n⚙️ Reducing manual reconciliation\n📊 Automating repetitive reporting\n💡 Surfacing investment insights faster\n✅ Improving operational accuracy\n\nThat's where #AI creates measurable value.\n\nHuman expertise remains the competitive advantage.\n\nAI gives experts more time to apply it.\n\nThe future belongs to firms that combine intelligent automation with experienced professionals.\n\nNot one or the other.\n\n📖 Explore Centevo's solutions for #FundManagement: https://centevo.se/\n\n#AssetManagement #InvestmentManagement #InvestmentOperations #AIinFinance #DigitalTransformation","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_financialservices-ai-fundmanagement-activity-7497570450399617027-DDTY"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Profile Centevo","url":"https://se.linkedin.com/company/centevo-ab"},"datePublished":"2026-08-11T12:21:33.988Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_wealthmanagement-fintech-digitaltransformation-activity-7492918130575548417-jWXL","text":"The future of wealth management in the Nordics isn't being defined by a single breakthrough technology.\n\nIt's being shaped by connected ecosystems.\n\nToday's asset managers need platforms that bring together portfolio management, fund administration, compliance, reporting, client onboarding, and investor communication into one seamless experience.\n\nDisconnected systems create unnecessary complexity.\n\nConnected platforms create better decisions.\n\nAs regulations evolve and client expectations continue to rise, firms that embrace integration will be better positioned to scale efficiently while maintaining the highest standards of governance.\n\nTechnology shouldn't simply automate existing processes.\n\nIt should transform the way investment firms operate.\n \n𝐇𝐨𝐰 𝐢𝐬 𝐲𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐨𝐫𝐠𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐧𝐞𝐱𝐭 𝐠𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐨𝐟 𝐰𝐞𝐚𝐥𝐭𝐡 𝐦𝐚𝐧𝐚𝐠𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭?\n\n📖 Learn more about Centevo's integrated solutions: https://centevo.se/en/ \n\n#WealthManagement #FinTech #DigitalTransformation #AssetManagement","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_wealthmanagement-fintech-digitaltransformation-activity-7492918130575548417-jWXL"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Profile Centevo","url":"https://se.linkedin.com/company/centevo-ab"},"datePublished":"2026-03-20T10:24:48.254Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_financialservices-profilesoftware-profilecentevo-activity-7440704893755002880-ijj_","text":"Yesterday, we attended Stockholm Fintech Week 2026, representing Profile Centevo, part of the Profile Software Group.\n\nThe event offered a valuable opportunity to discuss how wealth managers and fund administrators can transition from manual back-office processes to AI-augmented operations without replacing their existing infrastructure.\n\nDuring the event, our CEO, Stefanos Athanasiadis, joined the fireside chat “AI from Unique and Centevo”, sharing a practical perspective on agentic AI in financial operations.\n\nIt was a pleasure to share this experience with Unique, highlighting the value of complementary expertise in bringing agentic AI into regulated #FinancialServices.\n\n#ProfileSoftware #ProfileCentevo #AINativeFinance #AIInFinance #StockholmFintechWeek #SFW26","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_financialservices-profilesoftware-profilecentevo-activity-7440704893755002880-ijj_"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Profile Centevo","url":"https://se.linkedin.com/company/centevo-ab"},"datePublished":"2026-03-16T10:11:46.517Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_ai-agenticai-fundadministration-activity-7439252063479480321-Bem-","text":"We’re pleased to sponsor and participate in Stockholm Fintech Week 2026\n📆18–19 March |📍Stockholm\n\nMeet Profile Centevo in the Exhibitors’ Area, partnering with Unique, to discuss practical adoption of #AI-native finance and #AgenticAI in financial operations—scaling intelligent automation across #FundAdministration and #WealthManagement workflows.\n\nDon’t miss Stefanos Athanasiadis in the fireside chat “AI from Unique and Centevo”.\n\nFind out more: https://lnkd.in/dfxJ_--w\n\n#ProfileCentevo #ProfileSoftware #AINativeFinance #AIInFinance #StockholmFintechWeek #SFW26","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_ai-agenticai-fundadministration-activity-7439252063479480321-Bem-"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Profile Centevo","url":"https://se.linkedin.com/company/centevo-ab"},"datePublished":"2026-02-12T11:36:48.466Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_fundservices-assetmanagement-nordic-activity-7427677050854928384-19UB","text":"📣 Excited to share our long-term strategic agreement with Landkreditt Bank — advancing innovation across #FundServices and #AssetManagement. \nThis milestone strengthens our position as a trusted technology partner for #Nordic financial institutions, supporting modern fund operations with scalable, future-ready solutions.\n\nLearn more: https://lnkd.in/dET3fpGd\n\n#ProfileCentevo #ProfileSoftware #AssetManagement #FundServices #WealthTech #NordicFinance","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_fundservices-assetmanagement-nordic-activity-7427677050854928384-19UB"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Profile Centevo","url":"https://se.linkedin.com/company/centevo-ab"},"datePublished":"2025-12-15T11:43:24.059Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_profilecentevo-profilesoftware-teamculture-activity-7406297826026049536-Di-s","text":"An incredible offsite with the Profile Centevo team. We celebrated a year of record revenue and profitability, but we didn't stay comfortable.\n \nWe spent our time at Steningevik mapping out the next evolution of our platform: Agentic Orchestration. We are building the infrastructure for the future of intelligent finance.\n \nThank you to the team for the hard work, the candid feedback, and the shared vision.\n \nReady for what’s next. 🚀\n \n #ProfileCentevo #ProfileSoftware #TeamCulture","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/centevo-ab_profilecentevo-profilesoftware-teamculture-activity-7406297826026049536-Di-s"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Profile Centevo","url":"https://se.linkedin.com/company/centevo-ab","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Sibyllegatan 49","addressLocality":"Stockholm","addressRegion":"Stockholm","postalCode":"114 42","addressCountry":"SE"},"description":"Profile Centevo is a specialised provider of Asset and Fund Management solutions in the Nordic region.\n\nOur solutions cover the areas of Asset Management, Fund Management, Trust Management and Family Office, whilst offering powerful API connection gateways to large local Banks.\n\nWe create client value by offering a process that allows you to manage all aspects of your business digitally, from defining your clients, customising your offer and possibly using automatic asset allocation (robo-advice).\n\nWe offer a proven onboarding process, digital solutions and services that suite your business model and ambitions for growth.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":24,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQE_6IW6MEMO5g/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1663151840149/centevo_ab_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=rWJpT-9IkcFYa2u3JbUd2b0rEKXoh9MPQ0b6s0zWpJ0","description":"Profile Centevo","@type":"ImageObject"},"sameAs":"https://www.centevo.se"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
