    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Artificial Intelligence is receiving enormous attention across <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffinancialservices&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FinancialServices</a>.

But its greatest impact won't come from replacing investment professionals.

It will come from removing friction.

⚙️ Reducing manual reconciliation
📊 Automating repetitive reporting
💡 Surfacing investment insights faster
✅ Improving operational accuracy

That's where <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fai&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AI</a> creates measurable value.

Human expertise remains the competitive advantage.

AI gives experts more time to apply it.

The future belongs to firms that combine intelligent automation with experienced professionals.

Not one or the other.

📖 Explore Centevo's solutions for <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffundmanagement&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FundManagement</a>: <a class="link" href="https://centevo.se/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://centevo.se/</a>

