  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Profile Solutions UK: strengthening our presence in the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fukwealth&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#UKWealth</a> and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finvestmentmanagement&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#InvestmentManagement</a> market

Following the acquisition of Contemi Solutions (London) Limited, we are pleased to announce that the business has officially rebranded to Profile Solutions UK Limited.

This milestone reinforces Profile’s long-term commitment to the UK wealth and investment management market, combining established local expertise with the strength, scale and stability of the Profile Group.

With expanded operations in London and Leicester, Profile Solutions UK will continue to enhance Axia Suite with UK-focused capabilities, including regulatory compliance, market connectivity, corporate actions automation and AI-powered functionality designed to help firms streamline complex workflows and support innovation.

“The UK is a strategic market for Profile. The integration and rebranding of our UK operations, combined with the Group’s financial strength and international track record, give wealth and investment management firms a partner with both deep local expertise and the stability of an established, listed technology group.” <a class="link" href="https://gr.linkedin.com/in/evangelosangelides?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Evangelos Angelides</a>, CEO of Profile Software Group

<a class="link" href="https://gr.linkedin.com/company/profile-software?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Profile Software</a> Group serves financial institutions in over 50 countries worldwide, supported by more than 450 employees.

Read more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dRMrNqdU?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dRMrNqdU</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fprofilesoftware&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ProfileSoftware</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fprofilesolutionsuk&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ProfileSolutionsUK</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwealthtech&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WealthTech</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffinancialservices&amp;_l=sv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FinancialServices</a></p>
