  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Are you ready to move from AI curiosity to AI outcomes? 🤖 Join <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/the-wealth-mosaic?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Wealth Mosaic</a> and <a class="link" href="https://gr.linkedin.com/company/profile-software?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Profile Software</a> on 9 July 2026 for our latest WealthTech Talks Webinar as we explore the practical use-cases and real-world impacts of agentic AI on wealth management. 
 
🗓 WealthTech Talks: The agentic manager – How agentic AI is reshaping work in UK wealth management
📅 9 July 2026 | 10:00 AM BST | Free | Zoom
 
The session will cover:
🔹 Where agentic AI applies in wealth management today
🔹 Practical use cases delivering real, repeatable results
🔹 How to overcome deployment challenges and get started now
 
Hear from <a class="link" href="https://se.linkedin.com/in/stefanos-athanasiadis-35b319?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stefanos Athanasiadis</a>, Managing Director – Investments, <a class="link" href="https://gr.linkedin.com/company/profile-software?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Profile Software</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/stephenkwall?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stephen Wall</a>, Founder, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/the-wealth-mosaic?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Wealth Mosaic</a>, plus a senior UK wealth practitioner specialised in AI.
 
Whether you’re at the exploration stage or actively evaluating integration, join us and explore the possibilities agentic AI offers your business now.

Read the full announcement below to learn more about this webinar.
 
Interested in joining the webinar? Register now to secure your spot: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dywBb6zw?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dywBb6zw</a>
 
Attendance is free, but registration is required.
 
