  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">An incredible offsite with the <a class="link" href="https://se.linkedin.com/company/centevo-ab?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Profile Centevo</a> team. We celebrated a year of record revenue and profitability, but we didn't stay comfortable.
 
We spent our time at Steningevik mapping out the next evolution of our platform: Agentic Orchestration. We are building the infrastructure for the future of intelligent finance.
 
Thank you to the team for the hard work, the candid feedback, and the shared vision.
 
Ready for what’s next. 🚀
 
